  "page_number": 1,
  "section": "1. -(으)ㄹ게요",
  "text": "1. -(으)ㄹ게요\nMeaning: I will (a promise or decision, for the listener)\n제가 먼저 연락할게요. = I'll contact you first.\n내일 다시 올게요. = I'll come again tomorrow.\nExplanation: Only with I/we. Use -(으)ㄹ 거예요 for plans that don't involve the listener.",
  "topic": "1. -(으)ㄹ게요"
 },
