   "section": "4. -(으)면서",
   "source_type": "pdf",
   "topic": "4. -(으)면서"
  },
  "page_number": 1,
  "section": "4. -(으)면서",
  "text": "4. -(으)면서\nMeaning: While (doing two things at the same time)\n음악을 들으면서 공부해요. = I study while listening to music.\n커피를 마시면서 이야기했어요. = We talked while drinking coffee.\nExplanation: The same person does both actions.",
  "topic": "4. -(으)면서"
 },
