  "page_number": 1,
  "section": "5. -는 동안",
  "text": "5. -는 동안\nMeaning: During / While\n제가 자는 동안 비가 왔어요. = It rained while I was sleeping.\n기다리는 동안 책을 읽었어요. = I read a book while I was waiting.",
  "topic": "5. -는 동안"
 },
