  "page_number": 1,
  "section": "6. -(으)ㄹ까 봐",
  "text": "6. -(으)ㄹ까 봐\nMeaning: Worried that / In case\n늦을까 봐 택시를 탔어요. = I took a taxi because I was worried I'd be late.\n비가 올까 봐 우산을 가져왔어요. = I brought an umbrella in case it rains.",
  "topic": "6. -(으)ㄹ까 봐"
 },
