  "page_number": 2,
  "section": "Particles",
  "text": "Particles\nParticle\nMain function\nExample\n(으)로\nDirection or means\n지하철로 가요. — I go by subway.\n한테\nTo someone\n친구한테 문자를 보냈어요. — I sent a text to my friend.\n부터\nStarting point (time)\n아홉 시부터 일해요. — I work from nine.\n까지\nUntil / Up to\n밤늦게까지 공부했어요. — I studied until late at night.",
  "topic": "Particles"
 }
